        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead2Rise</strong> is a survival horror experience where every decision counts. Trapped in a collapsing old west village overrun by the undead, you must endure <strong>60 relentless days</strong> of escalating threats, scarce resources, and an unforgiving environment. Will you survive the outbreak — or become one of the dead? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for supplies, craft weapon ammo, fortify safe zones, and uncover the dark truth behind the infection. Every night, the horde grows stronger, faster, and more ruthless. The longer you survive, the deadlier the world becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead2Rise blends <strong>intense survival mechanics</strong>, <strong>dynamic enemy behavior</strong>, and a <strong>dark, atmospheric world</strong> that adapts to your playstyle. No two survival runs will ever be the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 Days of Survival</strong> – Each day brings new challenges, tougher enemies, and higher stakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undead Variety</strong> – Screamer, Reaper, Ghosts, Backbreaker, Hazmat, Flayer, Grinder, Wailer, Siren, and Ravager.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Crafting</strong> – Build weapons, barricades, and traps to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Horde System</strong> – Zombies respond to noise, light, and movement, forcing you to adapt constantly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong> – Every bullet, every bandage, every bit of stamina, energy, food, and hunger management matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> – Explore dark zones, abandoned streets, and hidden shelters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Playstyles</strong> – Go loud with firepower or sneak through the shadows — survival is in your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apocalypse has begun. The clock is ticking.<br><strong>Will you rise… or fall?</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead2Rise</strong> is a survival horror experience where every decision counts. Trapped in a collapsing old west village overrun by the undead, you must endure <strong>60 relentless days</strong> of escalating threats, scarce resources, and an unforgiving environment. Will you survive the outbreak — or become one of the dead? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for supplies, craft weapon ammo, fortify safe zones, and uncover the dark truth behind the infection. Every night, the horde grows stronger, faster, and more ruthless. The longer you survive, the deadlier the world becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead2Rise blends <strong>intense survival mechanics</strong>, <strong>dynamic enemy behavior</strong>, and a <strong>dark, atmospheric world</strong> that adapts to your playstyle. No two survival runs will ever be the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 Days of Survival</strong> – Each day brings new challenges, tougher enemies, and higher stakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undead Variety</strong> – Screamer, Reaper, Ghosts, Backbreaker, Hazmat, Flayer, Grinder, Wailer, Siren, and Ravager.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Crafting</strong> – Build weapons, barricades, and traps to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Horde System</strong> – Zombies respond to noise, light, and movement, forcing you to adapt constantly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong> – Every bullet, every bandage, every bit of stamina, energy, food, and hunger management matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> – Explore dark zones, abandoned streets, and hidden shelters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Playstyles</strong> – Go loud with firepower or sneak through the shadows — survival is in your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apocalypse has begun. The clock is ticking.<br><strong>Will you rise… or fall?</strong></p>",
